[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-kadarabrite-scholarship-2026-for-nigerians-500-opportunity-171":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},171,"kadarabrite-scholarship-2026-for-nigerians-500-opportunity-171","Kadarabrite Scholarship 2026 For Nigerians: $500 Opportunity","\u003Cp>Hurray! KadaraBrite Scholarship applications 2026 have commenced.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Karen Chukwu Scholarship Fund provides a $500 (₦800K) award for exceptional and resilient students to support their academic pursuit.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>KadaraBrite Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: KadaraBrite\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>$500 (₦800K)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 16, 2026KadaraBrite Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>KàdàràBrite Scholarships warmly welcomes orphans and vulnerable children (OVC) living in care who are enrolled in or have gained admission to a federal or state university in Ghana or Nigeria.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>The organization is dedicated to providing opportunities for these deserving individuals to achieve their academic dreams and unlock their full potential.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Through this initiative, we extend scholarships and financial grants aimed at easing the financial burden of university \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fkadarabrite-scholarship-fund\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>education\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa> and enabling access to quality learning experiences.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>These scholarships not only support academic pursuits but also foster personal and professional development, empowering orphaned students to excel in their chosen fields.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>2026 KadaraBrite Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The KadaraBrite Scholarship Fund aims to provide scholarships and financial grants to support up to four years of university education.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship award of $500 per academic year to support tuition fees and other \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fkadarabrite-scholarship-fund\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>educational\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa> expenses.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>KadaraBrite Scholarships Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the undergraduate KadaraBrite Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Not older than 27 years old (at some point in the year of application)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Must be enrolled in or have gained admission to a federal or state university\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be an orphaned students in Ghana and Nigeria.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Required Documents for KàdàràBrite Scholarship 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the KadaraBrite Scholarship, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Complete Application Form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic Transcripts\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proof of Admission\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Personal Statement\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Reference Letter\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>How To Apply for KadaraBrite Scholarship Fund 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the KadaraBrite Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click the button below to visit te program’s webpage.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Submit an online application form.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Provide necessary documents, including academic transcripts and proof of university admission in the scholarship application form.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicants who closely meet or exceed our criteria will progress to the next round which is a video interview.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Should you be selected for an interview, you will be required to prove that you meet the eligibility requirements listed above and a validation process will include a visit to the orphanage\u002Fchildren’s home and a meeting with the guardian.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fkadarabrite.org\u002Fapply\">https:\u002F\u002Fkadarabrite.org\u002Fapply\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-22 10:44:55",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fkadarabrite-scholarship-2026-for-nigerians-500-opportunity\u002F69e898978e2534.32254342_screenshot 2026-04-22 103920.p